# ---- Runtime data (NEVER commit) ----------------------------------------
# The server writes operational report backups next to itself. These can
# contain real field reports and must stay out of version control.
Auto Backups/
# `make run` keeps its backups, snapshots and TLS key here, outside dist/,
# so `make clean` can't delete them.
.dev-data/
# Beside the backup folder, so with `--backup-dir .dev-data` these land in the
# repo root: Done with Mission's finished missions, and the server's log.
Mission Archives/
Server Logs/
# Local files for manual testing (field-test exports, overlays).
test-data/

# ---- Build output --------------------------------------------------------
dist/
release/

